ggml-hindi2hinglish-apex-q5_0.bin is a format conversion and quantization of
Oriserve/Whisper-Hindi2Hinglish-Apex (https://huggingface.co/Oriserve/Whisper-Hindi2Hinglish-Apex),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
The weights were converted to whisper.cpp's ggml format and quantized to q5_0; they were not
otherwise modified.

convert-hf-whisper.py follows whisper.cpp's models/convert-h5-to-ggml.py (MIT License,
